# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
**/tfplan
**/*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Terraform lock file should be committed
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Ansible
**/*.retry

# Ansible Vault
**/vault_password_file
**/*vault*.yml
**/*vault*.yaml

# SSH / private keys
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS/editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Backup files
*.backup
